WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.520
Don't listen to your sister

00:01.600 --> 00:02.400
If you're unhappy

00:02.480 --> 00:03.480
In the army

00:03.560 --> 00:05.000
I'll submit a memorial to His Majesty

00:05.080 --> 00:06.360
To have you transferred back

00:06.440 --> 00:08.080
So you can stay by your sister's side

00:08.160 --> 00:09.560
So she won't worry

00:11.160 --> 00:13.240
Then I'd still like to stay in the army

00:13.320 --> 00:13.800
In the future

00:13.880 --> 00:17.213
I still need to help brother-in-law with the northern expedition

00:18.840 --> 00:20.240
Right

00:20.440 --> 00:22.107
Almost forgot the important matter

